{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068687879359090854","created_at":"2026-06-21T13:29:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068687879359090854"],"id":"2068687879359090854","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":49,"impression_count":98384,"like_count":1530,"quote_count":41,"reply_count":104,"retweet_count":235},"text":"你不要用很轻松的语气讲话然后自己偷偷哭","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068687879359090854"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068538625047117952","created_at":"2026-06-21T03:36:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068538625047117952"],"id":"2068538625047117952","lang":"zxx","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4918,"like_count":134,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":9},"text":"https://t.co/subIdwdc15","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068538625047117952"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068488133545701564","created_at":"2026-06-21T00:16:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068488133545701564"],"id":"2068488133545701564","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":3451,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":6},"text":"如果注定是失败的结局。喜欢一往无前的人，永远朝自己的目标咬牙切齿地前进，哪怕知道是镜中花水中月也要去打破寻一个切实的结局。\n你应该会想看看自己能走到哪","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068488133545701564"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068422127750193427","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:53:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068422127750193427"],"id":"2068422127750193427","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2186,"like_count":20,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我的情商和边界感说高不高说低不低吧，刚好卡在那个，说完了才意识到抱歉我是不是说得太多了，的界限","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068422127750193427"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068421922329874441","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:53:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068421922329874441"],"id":"2068421922329874441","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1799,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"每日状态：过度倾诉吓到每个看见我的人，然后反应过来抱歉我是不是又过度倾诉了……","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068421922329874441"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068421750195617824","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:52:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068421750195617824"],"id":"2068421750195617824","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2587,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":8},"text":"我曾经很贱过，现在也贱，以后更贱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068421750195617824"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068418301114601494","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:38:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068418301114601494"],"id":"2068418301114601494","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4996,"like_count":67,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":7},"text":"人生很吊诡的地方在于 你往往最心动的那个时刻 都是在你还没有准备好的时候遇到","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068418301114601494"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068416996891599173","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:33:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068416996891599173"],"id":"2068416996891599173","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":102,"impression_count":105873,"like_count":2034,"quote_count":13,"reply_count":79,"retweet_count":217},"text":"贫穷并没有激发我赚钱的欲望，反而让我变得懒散，让我失去行动力，反正努力也不一定有结果。贫穷让我心胸狭隘，暴躁，一点小事就感觉天塌了，让我失去对生活的掌控感，失去我的天真、热情和好奇。贫穷让我觉得日子漫长无趣，遇到一点困难就只想摆烂，贫穷让我找不到人生的方向，只能跌跌撞撞，恍恍惚惚","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068416996891599173"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068415797404540941","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:28:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068415797404540941"],"id":"2068415797404540941","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":6729,"like_count":132,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":22},"text":"话说不出来，因为关系还没有形成足够的“承载力”。\n更底层的话往往带着羞耻、恐惧、依赖、嫉妒、被抛弃感、自我怀疑，甚至是一些自己都不愿意承认的需求。\n人在没有安全感的时候，会先说比较浅的话，比如“你态度不好”“你不尊重我”“你根本不在乎我”但真正想说的可能是：“我很怕我对你不重要。”","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068415797404540941"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068415040609460699","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:25:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068415040609460699"],"id":"2068415040609460699","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1789,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"一切巧合不过是命运的玩笑，是你想把它当作缘分的托词","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068415040609460699"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068414377381028219","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:23:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068414377381028219"],"id":"2068414377381028219","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3079,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"再忙，也别忘了说别人坏话","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068414377381028219"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068411529326977362","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:11:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068411529326977362"],"id":"2068411529326977362","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1575,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":4},"text":"那段日子，确实不错，我也常想起，但没办法，回不去的日子总有它的道理","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068411529326977362"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068411212975718712","created_at":"2026-06-20T19:10:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068411212975718712"],"id":"2068411212975718712","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2025,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"你总说这样的话，希望我以后吃kumokumo时想起你，遇到什么选择时想起你，想到某句话某个问题时想起你，想到已经逝去的时光时想起你，看到海也想起你。\n你在铺垫吗，你在留下预言吗，这是从前的什么人给你造成的影响吗，你害怕被我遗忘吗？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068411212975718712"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068338200284987471","created_at":"2026-06-20T14:20:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068338200284987471"],"id":"2068338200284987471","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2847,"like_count":51,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我极度排斥一切毫无预兆的突发事件 不打招呼就突然出现 临时打乱安排的行为 对我而言不是简单的打扰 而是在直接冲击我赖以安心的秩序感这种失控感会瞬间点燃我的烦躁与反感 本能地生出强烈的抵触抗拒与厌恶 让我整个人都陷入不适","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068338200284987471"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068331938281345303","created_at":"2026-06-20T13:55:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068331938281345303"],"id":"2068331938281345303","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1866,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"凶宅其实是合租房","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068331938281345303"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2068325816031908186","created_at":"2026-06-20T13:31:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068325816031908186"],"id":"2068325816031908186","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2419,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我不再想自杀了，我只是在脑中一遍又一遍地过着我仅剩的记忆中艰难的童年以及青少年生活，而且我知道这痛苦还远远没到结束的时候","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068325816031908186"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2067998422452650408","created_at":"2026-06-19T15:50:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2067998422452650408"],"id":"2067998422452650408","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":48638,"like_count":688,"quote_count":21,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":142},"text":"解释为什么认识并爱上一些人:我那时候精神病发作了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2067998422452650408"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2067675993473692038","created_at":"2026-06-18T18:29:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2067675993473692038"],"id":"2067675993473692038","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3147,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我这次仅花了五分钟就成功惹恼了我前夫然后他气的直接睡着了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2067675993473692038"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2067547888608309404","created_at":"2026-06-18T10:00:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2067547888608309404"],"id":"2067547888608309404","in_reply_to_user_id":"1992208256547319808","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":329,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@yukui242277你咋了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2067547888608309404"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2067304755303719193","created_at":"2026-06-17T17:53:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2067304755303719193"],"id":"2067304755303719193","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2396,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我不知道为什么我对于结婚这个话题有特别特别深的恐惧…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2067304755303719193"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2067263993648205945","created_at":"2026-06-17T15:11:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2067263993648205945"],"id":"2067263993648205945","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":13872,"like_count":262,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":51,"retweet_count":53},"text":"我已经不想要任何需要我去用力抓住的关系了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2067263993648205945"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2067229754978369648","created_at":"2026-06-17T12:55:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2067229754978369648"],"id":"2067229754978369648","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2747,"like_count":41,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"分开这两个字确实很清淡，你说以后的日子没有你，我难免有些哽咽","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2067229754978369648"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2067228133691167163","created_at":"2026-06-17T12:49:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2067228133691167163"],"id":"2067228133691167163","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":6422,"like_count":105,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":10},"text":"我能想到最无可挽回的下场就是自杀失败变成傻子变成高位截瘫变成植物人","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2067228133691167163"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2067193892945211741","created_at":"2026-06-17T10:33:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2067193892945211741"],"id":"2067193892945211741","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3562,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我觉得天气气压真的至少对我的精神病影响很明显吧呃","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2067193892945211741"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2066905123117560311","created_at":"2026-06-16T15:25:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066905123117560311"],"id":"2066905123117560311","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":4767,"like_count":110,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":4},"text":"爱上头时人总是擅长承诺和诡辩，絮絮叨叨地个不停，只为了给爱人一个心安。\n他突然给我的承诺于我而言无异于洪荒猛兽，我打断他的巧舌，我说其实我不在乎的。\n我根本就不在乎你过去爱过谁，甚至也不在乎你以后会去爱谁，我只要你这一秒，我要惊天动地的一秒。\n我要这一秒，你甚至能心甘情愿为我死掉。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066905123117560311"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false},{"id":"1992208256547319808","name":"青提椰果鲜乳茶","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2065982360466886656/jMkcKGvn_normal.jpg","username":"yukui242277","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2068687879359090854","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3jueqin6a4olsrj5dcmhnx61tc5si9p","oldest_id":"2066905123117560311","result_count":25}}